<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Onebar - About/Rules</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
</head>
<body>
    <a href="/" class="btn home-button">Home</a>
    
    <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-header">
            <h1>Onebar</h1>
            <p>Just put the cards down lil bro</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>About This Project</h2>
            <p>Welcome to Onebar! This is an online multiplayer card game and totally not a copy. If you encounter any issues or have suggestions for new features, please reach out to the dev.</p>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p>Developed by <strong>Connor Y.</strong></p>
                <p>Feedback and suggestions are always welcome!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>How to Play</h2>
            <p>Each player starts with <strong>7 cards</strong>. The goal is to be the first to get rid of all your cards!</p>
            
            <h3 style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--secondary-color);">Matching Rules</h3>
            <p>To play a card, it must match the top card by:</p>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>Color</strong> - Same color as the current card</li>
                <li><strong>Number/Symbol</strong> - Same number or symbol</li>
                <li><strong>Wild Card</strong> - Can be played on any card</li>
                <li><strong>Turn Order</strong> - People take turns with the current plays turn and amount of cards listed</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>Special Cards</h2>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>Skip</strong> - Skips the next player's turn</li>
                <li><strong>Reverse</strong> - Reverses the direction of play</li>
                <li><strong>Draw Two (+2)</strong> - Next player draws 2 cards and loses their turn</li>
                <li><strong>Wild</strong> - Choose any color to continue play</li>
                <li><strong>Wild Draw Four</strong> - Choose any color AND the next player draws 4 cards and loses their turn</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>One Button</h2>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>Rule</strong> - Only press it when you have one card left</li>
                <li><strong>Penalty</strong> - If you forget or try to play the last card before pressing the button, you face a penalty</li>
                <li><strong>Remember</strong> - To keep pressing it if you get back to one card again</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>DigiPogs</h2>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>Earnable Pogs</strong> - Earn DigiPogs as you play and win games, get a multiplier for win bonus with the more people you play with</li>
                <li><strong>Use Pogs</strong> - Use DigiPogs to customize your profile, buy battlepasses and show off your achievements</li>
                <li><strong>Trade</strong> - Pay DigiPogs to play other games or services on different websites made by other people</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>Lobbies</h2>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>Create or Join</strong> - Create private lobbies to play with friends or join public ones to meet new players</li>
                <li><strong>Ownership</strong> - The creator of a lobby has special privileges to start the game</li>
                <li><strong>Payment</strong> - Lobbies require payment or have entry fees</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>Profile</h2>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>Leveling</strong> - Play games to earn XP to level up and unlock new features and rewards</li>
                <li><strong>Customization</strong> - Customize your profile with card backs, avatars, and more</li>
                <li><strong>XP bar</strong> - Ever want to check on your progress? Just check your profile and look at the xp bar</li>
                <li><strong>Sound Effects</strong> - Toggle sound effects on or off from your profile page</li>
                <li><strong>Change Photo</strong> - Update your profile picture with pre set pictures that you can earn in the game/pass</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
            <h2>Battle Pass</h2>
            <ul class="rules-list">
                <li><strong>50 Tiers</strong> - Progress through 50 tiers by leveling up. Each level you gain unlocks one battle pass tier</li>
                <li><strong>Free Rewards</strong> - Earn free rewards at key milestones (every 5 tiers) including coins, badges, and card backs</li>
                <li><strong>Premium Pass</strong> - Unlock the premium battle pass for 1000 DigiPogs to get exclusive rewards at almost every tier</li>
                <li><strong>Seasonal Content</strong> - Content of the pass may change to a different season, it will be updated and all users will be alerted if passes do come to change.</li>
                <li><strong>Navigation</strong> - Use the arrow buttons to browse through all 50 tiers and see what rewards await you</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>